{%- comment -%}
  ElmsNest S — PDP kicker (SIMPLIFY §8.2 item 2). One 13 px muted line above the h1:
    <a>{collection.title}</a> · מתאים כדי {yes}
  The collection is the elmsnest-s-place match for the product (menu order, skips `sale`);
  {yes} is the licensed infinitive from the same snippet. No match → nothing renders.
  Rendered from a `_liquid` block: {% render 'elmsnest-s-pdp-kicker', product: product %}
  Reads only `product` and the global `collections`. No place word, no numeral (owner answer 4).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture ens_kicker_handle -%}{%- render 'elmsnest-s-place', product: product, emit: 'collection' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture ens_kicker_yes -%}{%- render 'elmsnest-s-place', product: product, emit: 'yes' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign ens_kicker_handle = ens_kicker_handle | strip -%}
{%- assign ens_kicker_yes = ens_kicker_yes | strip -%}
{%- if ens_kicker_handle != '' -%}
{%- assign ens_kicker_coll = collections[ens_kicker_handle] -%}
{%- if ens_kicker_coll.title != blank -%}
<style>
.hdt-rte p.ens-kicker,p.ens-kicker{margin:0 0 6px;font-family:var(--env2-sans,Heebo,sans-serif);font-weight:400;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#c9c4b8;direction:rtl;text-align:start}
.hdt-rte a.ens-kicker__link,a.ens-kicker__link{color:#f4eee3;text-decoration:none;border-block-end:1px solid rgba(244,238,227,.25);padding-block-end:1px;transition:color .3s,border-color .3s}
.hdt-rte a.ens-kicker__link:hover,.hdt-rte a.ens-kicker__link:focus-visible,a.ens-kicker__link:hover,a.ens-kicker__link:focus-visible{color:#ffd394;border-color:#ffd394;text-decoration:none}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){a.ens-kicker__link{transition:none} }
</style>
<p class="ens-kicker" dir="rtl"><a class="ens-kicker__link" href="{{ ens_kicker_coll.url }}">{{ ens_kicker_coll.title }}</a>{% if ens_kicker_yes != '' %} · מתאים כדי {{ ens_kicker_yes }}{% endif %}</p>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
